# Expanding the Mission's Splash

Distribution's solved. "More splash" = new modes, not more platforms. Split by goal.

## Reach (Goal 1 — literacy)

- **Folkbildning** (ABF, Vuxenskolan, libraries, komvux). Mandate = literacy for non-curious adults — who video won't reach. Uniquely Swedish, credible. Top non-obvious move.
- **Text articles.** Search is where people land Googling "hallucinerar AI" at 11pm. Video is invisible to search; text is the funnel. (Also: podcast, newsletter.)
- **Teacher packs.** Episode → ready-to-teach lesson. Reaches teens + one teacher = 30 households.

## Authority (Goal 2 — the voice)

- **Be the number media calls.** Press-ready pitch + rapid commentary when AI hits DN/SvD/Aktuellt. Low-volume, high-authority.
- **Op-eds.** DN Debatt / SvD on AI literacy as public issue. How you get *cited*, not watched.
- **Panels / policy briefings.** Politicians don't get it — be who explains it to them.

## Build (digital — deepen + scale)

- **Interactive sandbox.** Let a non-technical person *make* a model hallucinate, watch tokenization, poke a tiny model. Video shows; a sandbox lets them *do* — durable understanding comes from doing. The thing video structurally can't be.
- **AI-literacy self-test.** "Hur AI-kunnig är du?" Shareable + the *only* thing here that measures Goal 1 (did understanding move?). Diagnostic routes you to the right episode.
- **Live four-bucket claim tracker.** Public searchable DB of circulating AI claims, each tagged 1–4. Turns the signature framework into a destination site, not just a device — SEO gold, always current.
- **Swedish AI glossary.** SEO capture for "vad är [term]" searches. Non-technical people search terms first; own that surface.

## Does both

- **Make the four-bucket framework travel.** One-pager + Swedish shorthand so others *ask* "varaktig fakta eller cirkulerande påstående?" without you present. Literacy spreads (G1) + every use attributed to you (G2). Highest ceiling. (The claim tracker above is this, productized.)

## Tradeoff

Reach wants volume + institutions. Authority wants scarcity + gatekeeper citations. One calendar can't max both.

